The law texts in this repository are official texts of Bosnian-Podrinje Canton Goražde (Bosansko-podrinjski kanton
Goražde), Federation of Bosnia and Herzegovina, taken from the official gazette Službene novine Bosansko-podrinjskog
kantona Goražde as published on the Canton's website,
https://bpkg.gov.ba/sluzbene-novine/7102/sluzbene-novine-bpk-gorazde (consulted 2026-10-30).

Izvor (source): Službene novine Bosansko-podrinjskog kantona Goražde, Bosansko-podrinjski kanton Goražde,
https://bpkg.gov.ba/. The Canton's website forbids taking or distributing its content without naming the source
("Zabranjeno je svako neovlašteno preuzimanje i distribucija sadržaja bez navođenja izvora informacija"); anyone who
reuses these texts should keep this attribution.

They are not protected by copyright. Zakon o autorskom i srodnim pravima (Službeni glasnik BiH 63/10), član 8
("Nezaštićene tvorevine"), stav (1): "Autorskopravno nisu zaštićeni: [...] b) službeni tekstovi iz oblasti
zakonodavstva, uprave i sudstva (zakoni, uredbe, odluke, izvještaji, zapisnici, sudske odluke i slično)". (Official
texts in legislation, administration and the judiciary - laws, decrees, decisions, reports, minutes, court decisions
and the like - are not protected by copyright.)

This repository is not an official publication; the binding text is the one published in the official gazette,
Službene novine Bosansko-podrinjskog kantona Goražde.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
